"No backup yet." = "Henüz yedek yok.";
"No folder chosen" = "Klasör seçilmedi";
"Older copies of this Mac's series are deleted after a new one has been written and verified. Files Keepit did not write here are never touched." = "Bu Mac’in serisindeki eski kopyalar, yenisi yazılıp doğrulandıktan sonra silinir. Keepit’in buraya yazmadığı dosyalara asla dokunulmaz.";
